<title>FRANCE: Details of ONIC 1997 grain sowing estimates.</title>
<headline>Details of ONIC 1997 grain sowing estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC issued the following estimates for 1997 grain sowings (1997 figures and 1996 comparisons in hectares, year-on-year change in percent).</p>
<p>					    1997	 1996	Change</p>
<p>    Soft wheat (winter/spring)  4,950,600  4,754,160   4.13</p>
<p>    Durum (winter/spring)	   256,840    269,775  -4.79</p>
<p>    Barley (winter/spring)	1,611,640  1,526,585   5.57</p>
<p>    Rye				    48,270     48,920  -1.33</p>
<p>    Oats				  128,650    139,890  -8.03</p>
<p>    Maize			     1,730,550  1,715,635   0.87</p>
<p>    Sorghum				66,900     55,045  21.54</p>
<p>    Triticale			   198,360    198,450  -0.05</p>
<p>    TOTAL			     8,991,810  8,708,460   3.25</p>
</text>
